@base = http://localhost:8000
# HTTP-клиент должен сохранять cookie session из ответа login.
# VS Code REST Client: включите cookie jar. Для curl используйте -c cookies.txt -b cookies.txt.

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Login client
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"client","password":"demo-pass-2026"}

### Products
GET {{base}}/api/products

### Preview: financial rejection with a possible alternative
POST {{base}}/api/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"company_name":"ООО Учебный Пекарь","tax_id":"7700000001","product_id":"working_capital","amount":600000,"term_months":12,"purpose":"Закупка сырья для пекарни","revenue_monthly":60000,"expenses_monthly":10000,"existing_payment":0,"business_months":36,"consent":true}

### Create an automatically approved application
# @name created
POST {{base}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{"company_name":"ООО Учебный Пекарь","tax_id":"7700000001","product_id":"working_capital","amount":600000,"term_months":12,"purpose":"Закупка сырья для пекарни","revenue_monthly":1500000,"expenses_monthly":1000000,"existing_payment":100000,"business_months":36,"consent":true}

### Submit (VS Code REST Client uses the preceding named response)
POST {{base}}/api/applications/{{created.response.body.$.id}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Accept simulated offer
POST {{base}}/api/applications/{{created.response.body.$.id}}/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List
GET {{base}}/api/applications

### Login bank (replaces the current cookie)
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"analyst","password":"demo-pass-2026"}

### Bank queue
GET {{base}}/api/applications

### Request clarification: replace id with a manual_review application
@reviewId = REPLACE_WITH_MANUAL_REVIEW_ID
POST {{base}}/api/applications/{{reviewId}}/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"request_info","note":"Поясните причину учебной просрочки и её текущий статус."}

### Logout
POST {{base}}/api/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}
